sequenceDiagram
    participant API
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant W as Outbox Relay
    participant R as Redis
    API->>PG: BEGIN
    API->>PG: INSERT appointment (exclusion constraint)
    API->>PG: INSERT outbox_events (AppointmentBooked)
    API->>PG: COMMIT (both or neither)
    PG-->>W: NOTIFY outbox (wake-up) / polling fallback
    W->>PG: SELECT … FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
    W->>R: INCR avail:ver:{dealershipId}:{date}
    W->>PG: mark processed
